    "name": "MX - SSO",
    "description": "This Postman collection supports API testing of the MX Proxy – SSO endpoints. It is intended for validating SSO-related APIs and passthrough data retrieval via the MX Proxy.\n\n# Quick Links\n\n- [Passthrough Create](https://extensibility-api.postman.co/workspace/68b02a61-3965-420f-b3b8-3bd911f20b6a/folder/8321995-21b99194-a6ce-4216-bc28-7ab948fad540?action=share&source=copy-link&creator=8321995)\n    \n- [Passthrough Read](https://extensibility-api.postman.co/workspace/68b02a61-3965-420f-b3b8-3bd911f20b6a/folder/8321995-acb5b463-6aa3-4d8a-830d-83948f810168?action=share&source=copy-link&creator=8321995)\n    \n- [Passthrough Delete](https://extensibility-api.postman.co/workspace/68b02a61-3965-420f-b3b8-3bd911f20b6a/folder/8321995-df24edb0-fbcf-4afa-9b25-6014991ac994?action=share&source=copy-link&creator=8321995)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "8321995",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/8321995-d175533f-e5de-46b0-aae9-be7f657143d1?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔗 Passthrough Create",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Generate Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "const accessToken = jsonData.access_token;",
                  "",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"access_token\", accessToken);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{client_secret}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{client_id}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "transactionId",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "institutionId",
                "value": "{{institution_id}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "client_credentials",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apigee_base_url}}/oauth2/v1/token",
              "host": [
                "{{apigee_base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth2",
                "v1",
                "token"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Passthrough Create",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const path = pm.environment.get(\"mx_sso_resource_path\").replace(/\\/$/, \"\");",
                  "const userId = pm.environment.get(\"user_id\");",
                  "",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"mx_sso_resource_path_post\", `${path}/${userId}/urls`);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "correlationId",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "ext_host",
                "value": "{{mx_sso_host}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "{{mx_accept}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "{{mx_content_type}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"url\": {\n        \"is_mobile_webview\": false,\n        \"style\": {\n            \"font_name\": \"Roboto\"\n        },\n        \"type\": \"connect_widget\",\n        \"use_cases\": [\n            \"PFM\"\n        ],\n        \"ui_message_version\": 4\n    }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apigee_base_url}}/mx/{{institution_id}}/{{mx_sso_resource_path_post}}",
              "host": [
                "{{apigee_base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "mx",
                "{{institution_id}}",
                "{{mx_sso_resource_path_post}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Forward a create request to the MX API through the Apigee passthrough.\n\n```\nPOST /mx/{{institution_id}}/{{mx_sso_resource_path_post}}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "## 🔄 MX SSO Passthrough Create Flow\n\n| **Step** | Request Name | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Generate Access Token | Obtain an access token using client credentials to authorize API requests. |\n| 2 | Passthrough Create | Send a POST request through the proxy, mapping to the corresponding MX SSO API resource. |",
      "event": [
